WEBVTT

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.230
Extendeds.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.780
A deformed existence that is created by
supplementing something one lacks

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.190
with something else.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:20.530
Comical, yet somewhat beautiful.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:26.110
My name is Andy Wachowski.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:32.730
In the past, I worked with Berühren to
create the theory of extension technology.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.980
And as its creator,

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:41.030
I cannot forgive the outrageous actions
of the Berühren company.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:46.780
Gun Slave Units have a limiter
that they cannot release without

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.230
the authorization of their Hands.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:58.320
Master Tetsuro, the hacking abilities of
Harmony is needed to remove that limiter

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.480
so Device 13 can fight
evenly against Seven.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:15.730
Now, for my sake,
unleash the power of that man.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.360
We have Master Tetsuro's body here.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.110
He will not be able to put
up much of a struggle.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.820
Take care not to injure him
too much during capture.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:41.780
Though, it seems a little discipline is needed.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:17.480
I'm Dreaming

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:30.110
Who would have thought I'd be having
my rematch with you like this?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:37.730
I doubt my anger will subside by defeating
you while you are controlled by a child...

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.900
But I shall not hold back.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:54.230
You bastard!

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:59.480
Even though he is in a Gun Slave Unit,

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.690
why are they having
so much trouble with a child?

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:05.110
Go join them, Kunugi.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.730
But...

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.900
I am the only one here.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.360
Well, then.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.780
What a foolish child.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:22.530
I extended my hand out to him
because I had found him pitiful.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:33.480
It seems we have no choice,
but to extract Harmony somehow...

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.570
Be quiet.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.980
If you call for help,

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.730
I will unplug the life-support system
connected to your chair.

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:46.780
Harmony is definitely still active.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:51.110
You should be inside Device 13 right now.

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:55.610
I used Harmony to hack into my own sub-brain.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.690
Your own sub-brain?!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.820
I wasn't controling Juzo from the start.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.570
Wha--?!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.190
Bastard!

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:19.280
Weren't you being controlled by that brat?!

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.690
That kid.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:28.150
He asked me to help him so he
could settle his own problems himself.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:34.150
He's always asked me not
to get involved until now.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:38.150
You get to decide your own worth.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:45.360
He accepted his own weakness and still
said he'd move forward in front of me.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:51.860
Damn. That kid has learned to say
some pretty cocky things!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:58.820
I needed to talk with you alone one more time.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:04.230
Now, why don't we start negotiations,
Professor Wachowski?

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:14.320
There is only one thing I want.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:19.980
I want Spitzbergen to stop committing
any more acts of terrorism.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:36.440
To call something like that a negotiation...

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:42.230
No, my apologies.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:46.230
For this demand, that affects
the very basis of Spitzbergen,

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:49.400
what will you give in return?

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:53.900
Do you really think you have
something befitting of such a trade?

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:57.320
I cannot imagine that you do...

00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:58.530
Me.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:04.280
I will hand myself over to you.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:08.780
You wanted me to eliminate Seven.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:14.070
The Gun Slave Unit working with Berühren,
also known as Seven.

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:19.400
He has become a great
obstacle in our activities.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:25.070
I can inhibit the powers of a
Gun Slave Unit with just Harmony.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.360
There is no need for Juzo.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:35.070
Should I call this a wonderful
example of self-sacrifice?

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:42.030
It seems your guilt in aiding terrorist
activity has made you think in this way.

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.900
I do not plan to sacrifice anyone.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.650
Including myself.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:51.280
That is quite a lofty ideal.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:58.190
Though I have lost my memories as the
son of Berühren's CEO, Tetsuro Arahabaki,

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:02.610
I know what they do in the shadows.

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:08.360
Such cruel experiments should be
stopped as soon as possible.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.610
And so, you will hand yourself over to us?

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:14.190
I will cooperate with you!
Until Seven is defeated.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:21.860
There should be ways to show Berühren's crimes
to the public that doesn't involve terrorism.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:26.230
I want Spitzbergen to think of another method.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:36.400
You were quite lucky to be released with
all your limbs intact a few days ago.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:42.730
Many in the organization wanted
to kill you as a warning to Berühren

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:47.150
or use you as a bargaining chip.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:53.730
Do you think such people would
be willing to lend their ears to you?

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:59.320
It seems you have already prepared yourself.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:03.320
However, you understand nothing.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:08.110
Do you know why the anti-extension
organization commits terrorism?

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.190
It's because there is no other choice.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:18.570
After the great war, Berühren gained
control over half of the country.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:23.530
The government is their loyal dog,
the press is controlled,

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:27.230
and the economy is manipulated
to endorse Extendeds.

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.400
I understand that the power
of Berühren is immense.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:34.940
Then, do you know their
final objective with that power?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:42.860
Have you ever thought about the reason
they conduct such cruel experiments?

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.400
Well...

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:55.530
Come to think of it, I still haven't told
you the reason I am a part of Spitzbergen.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.440
No, the very reason I created this organization.

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:02.030
Created?! You?

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.280
Yes.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:09.230
I wanted to change Berühren and extension
technology back to what it once was.

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:15.320
Long ago, before you were even conceived,

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:22.570
Berühren was an institution that focused
purely on research and development.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:27.690
The board officers known as Wurzel,
who founded Berühren...

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.150
CSO Strange.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.650
CTO Dreamy.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.690
CMO Timid.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:38.280
And COO Honest.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:42.820
I was an engineer that had
worked directly under them.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.440
We struggled against this world,

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:50.280
researching extension technology
so humans could live fully as humans.

00:10:51.820 --> 00:11:00.030
That was also the wish of Honest,
who was the central figure of Wurzel.

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:09.980
However, as the years passed,
their form and ideals slowly degenerated.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:15.650
The research in order <i>to live</i>
became the research <i>not to die</i> .

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:20.940
And funding that research
became their main objective.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:27.860
Berühren has become a giant life-support
system for a group of ugly elders

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:32.030
that are desperately clinging to life.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:35.320
Then what about the CEO Souichiro Arahabaki?

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:40.610
Wasn't my father the one who gave orders
for the illegal human experiments?

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:49.440
He... No, his name has been used as the
public face of Wurzel for generations.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:56.570
Even now, your father should
be working under Honest.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:03.320
After the war, I escaped from the
Berühren that Wurzel controlled

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:11.570
"Anti Extension"

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.320
and created the organization Spitzbergen.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:11.570
I did it in order to monitor Berühren
and warn the rest of the world.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:17.610
However, most of the organization members
here are victims of Extended crime.

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:22.480
Over time, it became a place where
those against the government gather,

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:26.230
"Anti Extension"

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:26.230
distorting its original principle.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:32.320
Now, it's just a terrorist group that
wishes to stamp out extension technology.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:38.190
Unfortunately, I can no longer stop
the actions of this organization.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.820
No way!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.400
But there is still a way to fight against them.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:48.940
I need Gun Slave Unit Device 13 for that.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.530
Not yet!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:04.940
The match hasn't been decided yet,
you profane existence!

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:07.690
That's great and all, however...

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:12.730
...it looks like you've improved your armor
but you're still flesh and bone inside.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:21.780
I can't guarantee your life
if we keep going at it like this.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:24.900
What was that?

00:13:33.280 --> 00:13:35.030
These can't be?!

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:54.280
I can hit trigger points with my needle bullets,
controlling the condition of Extendeds at will.

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:59.230
Sorry, but I've already heard
of that technique elsewhere.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.980
Oh, I remember now.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:07.940
You're the strange man who hangs out
with Kronen, even though you're an Extended.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:12.690
It's difficult having an inadequate junior.

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:14.400
Kunugi!

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.530
The brat isn't controlling this man!

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:21.360
The brat is still inside, near the elder!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.320
I see. I guessed as much.

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:32.860
There weren't many disturbances
in his neural system for being controlled.

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:34.860
Kunugi, you bastard!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:38.480
If you knew, why did you
leave the elder's side?!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:43.400
It is your duty to protect him!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:50.980
A single child with his Harmony sealed
is not a danger to that old man, Shimazu.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.940
What?

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:56.360
As long as we hold this Extended back.

00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:01.570
Hold me back?

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:08.150
Looks like you all don't get it.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:13.190
I'm the one holding all of you back.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:15.530
You can still move.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:18.980
I can see why Kronen couldn't handle you.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.530
What a troublesome guy.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:26.900
He didn't depend on my power from the start.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:32.360
He's trying to do something
you can't do with just your fists.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:37.150
And I won't let you get in the way!

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:45.230
The reason I want Device 13,
which you call Juzo Inui...

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:58.280
Destroying Device 7, known as Seven,
will destroy the very core of Wurzel.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.780
What do you mean?

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:07.860
Device 13 is the only device I involved
myself with during every step of production.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:15.730
There is a certain setting that none
of the other Gun Slave Units have.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:23.480
That setting I implemented is the very
difference between me and Wurzel.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:29.730
I am sure that Wurzel is the only one
who would understand that difference...

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.440
No, only Honest and I would understand.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:35.820
That is what is important.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:41.400
If I can destroy the delusions of Wurzel
and weaken their power,

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:48.030
Berühren will return to its former glory.

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:52.820
If that happens, silencing the acts of
terrorism would no longer be a dream.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.400
Do you understand now?

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.320
The reason Device 13 is needed.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:04.730
Using Harmony to release
the true power of Device 13

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.780
will be the key to bringing this
country a new era of peace.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:19.530
The honorable sacrifice of Device 13 will make
your dream come true, Master Tetsuro.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:32.440
As the organization's representative,
I thank you for your assistance, Master Tetsuro.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:44.280
I see...

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:50.280
I took your hand at that time
to right the wrongs of Berühren.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:53.190
Do you remember now?

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:58.070
I didn't know what kind of person
I was before I lost my memory.

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:03.780
Because of that, I recklessly caused
other people a lot of trouble.

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:10.230
But, thanks to you, I understand who I am
a little more so I can overcome that hurdle.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.780
Right now, I am not a person
who can obey someone

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:22.480
who talks about sacrificing another so easily.

00:18:23.780 --> 00:18:25.230
Professor.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:30.230
I will not give up on making my ideals
a reality without the sacrifice of others.

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:34.730
That's why I won't allow you
to hurt my friend, Juzo!

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:42.440
I didn't realize you were this stupid.

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.980
It seems any further argument is useless.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:51.730
It will be difficult to find someone
compatible with Harmony, but no matter.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:19:00.400
I will remove your head carefully
and extract Harmony from you.

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:11.030
You were an Extended!

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:13.030
Didn't I tell you?

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:19.780
I created extension technology
to struggle against this world.

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.690
What will you do now?

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:25.030
Are you going to beg Device 13 for help?

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:31.030
The nerves of an old man
cannot fully control this body,

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:38.530
but it will be easy to defeat someone
with legal extensions that lack power.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:47.190
If you could have used Harmony,
you may have had a chance against me.

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:58.230
Unless I release it, Harmony will
remain locked in its current position.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:02.530
In other words, it will stay
locked on your own sub-brain.

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:07.320
What's wrong?

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:10.730
Do you plan to protect that
boy with a body like that?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.610
Protect?

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.280
True, I promised him that.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:24.690
But that was only until he
could walk on his own two feet.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:30.570
Well... it's not like that
changes much of what I do.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:37.110
I'll play with you guys...
until you all are completely satisfied!

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:48.650
No matter what pretty words
you claim, this is reality.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:53.730
No matter how noble your cause,
blood will spill if you fight,

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.780
and the weak die.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:58.610
I know.

00:20:58.610 --> 00:21:02.320
I know that I am only spouting idealism.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:08.900
Justice that doesn't put your own life
on the line is just an empty pipe dream.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:12.570
It's just as you say, Juzo.

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:15.730
It seems you are getting disoriented.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.980
Device 13 isn't here right now.

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:23.820
You have no way to fight back, Master Tetsuro!

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:35.030
But...

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:37.190
Even so...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.320
Even though I know it's a pipe dream...

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:47.530
...I can't help being
enamored by the beauty of it!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:50.530
I'll put my life on the line...

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.570
...to grasp that dream!

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:29.980
This is the end, profane existance!

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:31.070
All action causes a reaction.

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:33.230
I told you he was an inadequate junior.

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:35.400
Bastard, what did you do with Tetsuro?

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:33.230
All action causes a reaction.

00:23:33.230 --> 00:23:35.400
Become mine.

00:23:35.400 --> 00:23:41.900
<i>NO GUNS LIFE</i> . Episode 21.
"Degeneration."
